  "material_note": "wall_door01: a dark plank door.\nwall_door03: an iron-bound plank door.\nhouse_stone_out: a rubble-stone wall.\nlight_02: a strip of flat light - the lit window, drawn additively.",
  "additive": [
    "light_02"
