  "why_this_one": "23 of them: house walls with a lit window, which flickers.",
  "effects_note": "MoveObject, case WD_2DEVIAS, type 78: `o->BlendMeshLight = (rand() % 4 + 4) * 0.1` every frame (:3902-3904) -- the window re-rolls 0.4 to 0.7 each frame. Carried as a glow of that range at 25 Hz, smoothed a little so it flickers rather than strobes.",
